  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grant to UNFPA TEENS Project 2022/23 Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x2018;Technology and Empowerment Enhancing Networks in Safe Spaces&#x2019; (TEENS) project employs iterative design approaches and new technologies in the support to safe spaces for vulnerable women and adolescent girls. It employs sophisticated iterative programming responding to context and individuals (mentees) with the overall the aim to contribute to transformation of targeted young women and girls. Safe Spaces as a methodology is proven to work to protect and empower young girls in Malawi. The unique aspects of this Ireland funded work is implementation in a peri-urban area and introduction of IT to enhance the model. This initiative responds to our gender audit in specifically targeting young women and it also advances a commitment in A Better World to increase support to sexual and reproductive health</narrative>
  </description>
